{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2023-06-02 17:30:00', 'title': "KEEL OF PITTSBURGH (LPD 31) AUTHENTICATED AT HII'S INGALLS SHIPBUILDING", 'text': "PASCAGOULA, MISS., JUNE 02, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) INGALLS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION HAS CEREMONIALLY AUTHENTICATED THE KEEL TODAY FOR THE SAN ANTONIO-CLASS AMPHIBIOUS TRANSPORT DOCK PITTSBURGH (LPD 31). THE KEEL IS THE FOUNDATION OF THE SHIP AND THE AUTHENTICATION CEREMONY IS THE FIRST IMPORTANT MILESTONE IN A SHIP'S LIFE."}